4085 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Corner Radius\015\nAlways use rounded corners on cards\054 buttons\054 and containers\056 Generous radius \024 never tight\056 12px small\n\nShapes \046 Decorative Elements\nBackground shapes use curves from the D terminal\056 Not perfect circles\056 Not hard rectangles\056 Arcs\054 sweeps\n\nGradients Follow the Curve\nApply gradients along curved paths\056 The coral to orange gradient should feel like it flows \024 the curve\n\nNever Hard Corner These\015\nButtons\054 tags\054 badges\054 labels\054 social assets\054 product packaging\056 All carry the curve language consistently\n\015\nWhat This Is Not\nNot bubble design\056 Not softness for softness sake\056 The KITD curve is athletic \024 like the aerodynamic curve of)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 4086 0 R
     /Pg 2526 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
